            around classical solutions of the IKKT model are in
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                H. Aoki,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Noboyuki+Ishibashi"} Noboyuki Ishibashi
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hikaru+Kawai"} Hikaru Kawai
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Noncommutative Yang-Mills in IIB Matrix Model
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9908141"} arXiv:hep-th/9908141
            %li
