          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Brandenberger"}> Robert Brandenberger
                , Julia Pasiecznik:
                %em
                  On the Origin of the
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
